{"v": 4, "paragraphs": ["Debby Lagranha compartilhou fotos do seu casamento com Gustavo Farias e se declarou ao marido. \"Eu já não sei se o girassol abraçou o sol ou o sol se encantou com o girassol\", disse ela abraçada ao esposo.", "A veterinária, que ficou conhecida como integrante da Turma do Didi quando era criança, se casou em uma cerimônia para os mais íntimos, ao ar livre, na última quarta-feira, 18. Debby tem dois filhos do casamento anterior, Maria Eduarda e Arthur.", "Veja fotos!"], "images": ["https://s2-gshow.glbimg.com/sRBQTwVmf21vquWjTLWgdOtxCqM=/1920x0/filters:format(jpeg)/https://i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_e84042ef78cb4708aeebdf1c68c6cbd6/internal_photos/bs/2026/4/j/Yc1n4rSUAJEikk9nlHiQ/fotojet-2026-11-19t205157.912.jpg", "https://s2-gshow.glbimg.com/SmnftI07tk8GD5aSiIeOn8KiBJ0=/0x0:3072x4096/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_e84042ef78cb4708aeebdf1c68c6cbd6/internal_photos/bs/2026/V/6/oA3cTMRH2AWdgAzhvNIA/912148476-18651809473015235-8017341956563403240-n.jpg", "https://s2-gshow.glbimg.com/RziksAqvuP3zqDautP6804Yqo8Y=/0x0:3071x4096/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_e84042ef78cb4708aeebdf1c68c6cbd6/internal_photos/bs/2026/V/2/BbOqPMRSeEFJ5BGcBHhg/910629306-18651809527015235-4958568576204414106-n.jpg", "https://s2-gshow.glbimg.com/H_0_ROZJhC7_z2_JEJSKwzUNqLU=/0x0:1161x1548/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_e84042ef78cb4708aeebdf1c68c6cbd6/internal_photos/bs/2026/F/A/ii8Yl0S2AsJ3bQKJYLNQ/910718919-18651809425015235-5153709082255149879-n.jpg", "https://s2-gshow.glbimg.com/or2uswcrgTT9opNxBzkl8D8zVcE=/0x0:3072x4096/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_e84042ef78cb4708aeebdf1c68c6cbd6/internal_photos/bs/2026/A/9/cZkzSuQpyvn7STAyBgWw/917452831-18651809506015235-7177386413995343996-n.jpg", "https://s2-gshow.glbimg.com/8gDyZUR0ier1Bv2sk9RIdHP4zSo=/0x0:3072x4096/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_e84042ef78cb4708aeebdf1c68c6cbd6/internal_photos/bs/2026/s/g/